  "txt": {
    "h1": "Acoustic and lighting design, as one.",
    "sub": "onoff studio is the Indigoff design studio for spaces that need to sound as good as they look.",
    "whatH": "We design how a space sounds and how it is lit — together.",
    "whatP1": "Most projects treat acoustics and lighting as two separate problems. At onoff studio we solve them as one: every fixture we design absorbs sound and shapes light at the same time, so ceilings and walls stay clean and the room feels calm.",
    "whatP2": "We work with architects, interior designers and end clients on offices, hospitality, education and retail — from a single statement piece to the full acoustic and lighting plan of a building.",
