    "desH": "onoff studio designs",
    "desP": "Acoustic lighting designed by onoff studio and made by Indigoff from recycled PET felt.",
    "ctaH": "Let’s design your space.",
    "ctaP": "Tell us about your project and the onoff studio team will propose an acoustic and lighting concept.",
